there's been a deficit coming out of the net.

00:19:42.567 --> 00:19:42.900
Third.

00:19:43.367 --> 00:19:43.533
Third.

00:19:43.667 --> 00:19:47.467
Third. Okay. So with the budget work that you all have done, and

