00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:08.033
But...

00:20:08.967 --> 00:20:09.767
Not but, and.

00:20:10.967 --> 00:20:13.967
With that, the work that you did on the budget this year,

00:20:15.233 --> 00:20:19.166
