00:20:24.867 --> 00:20:28.667
budget does is it adjusts for what I feel is prior

00:20:28.734 --> 00:20:29.734
years' under-budgeting.

00:20:29.934 --> 00:20:30.066
Okay.

00:20:30.634 --> 00:20:34.433
Just as we've looked through just all types of costs, there are many

00:20:34.533 --> 00:20:37.266
