00:21:05.033 --> 00:21:07.333
Barring unknowns, including world events.

00:21:07.567 --> 00:21:09.266
Yeah.

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:09.300
Yeah.

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:09.867
I understand that.

00:21:10.233 --> 00:21:14.300
Yes.

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:17.567
Good evening. I'm Johanna Prince. I'm the assistant superintendent.

