01:30:45.600 --> 01:30:46.233
councilors'

01:30:47.467 --> 01:30:48.734
positions and

01:30:50.533 --> 01:30:54.500
consider that. I first want to say, I really

01:30:54.567 --> 01:30:58.467
hope that this community and the councilors engage in this

01:30:58.500 --> 01:31:01.767
