01:31:11.266 --> 01:31:13.900
to try to act with kindness and compassion.

01:31:15.734 --> 01:31:16.634
I have been

01:31:18.300 --> 01:31:22.166
frustrated by these discussions and sort of watching the

01:31:22.200 --> 01:31:26.100
school board process over the last several years, and this is very personal

01:31:26.166 --> 01:31:29.200
to me. I have a child in the current school system.

01:31:29.400 --> 01:31:31.634
I have two children who've gone through the school system.

01:31:33.533 --> 01:31:33.767
I

01:31:34.767 --> 01:31:37.200
came to the first council

01:31:38.000 --> 01:31:41.834
school board meeting, I think, asking for a sort of right sizing

01:31:41.934 --> 01:31:45.467
of the school board budgetIn

01:31:45.867 --> 01:31:49.300
those presentations or the presentation that was provided,

01:31:50.300 --> 01:31:53.333
the enrollment numbers have, I think,

01:31:53.367 --> 01:31:56.734
drastically decreased. And our budget,

01:31:57.934 --> 01:32:01.133
