01:32:01.166 --> 01:32:05.066
million to above $75 million over the last

01:32:05.133 --> 01:32:05.800
five years.

01:32:07.967 --> 01:32:11.266
I know that it is challenging to make

01:32:11.333 --> 01:32:15.000
cuts. I know that it's challenging to lose positions.

01:32:15.066 --> 01:32:18.467
It has impacted my family specifically, and

01:32:18.767 --> 01:32:20.066
I feel that.

01:32:20.967 --> 01:32:24.900
I also don't feel that it's appropriate when our enrollment is going

01:32:24.967 --> 01:32:28.934
down and our school system is shrinking, to increase

01:32:28.967 --> 01:32:31.200
our school budget year after year.

01:32:31.367 --> 01:32:35.233
And I think we have to right-size our budget, and we

01:32:35.266 --> 01:32:37.433
have to rip off the Band-Aid.

01:32:38.467 --> 01:32:38.500
I

01:32:39.333 --> 01:32:43.233
