01:32:50.634 --> 01:32:54.567
That is very challenging. We have to cut staff because we have lower

01:32:54.700 --> 01:32:58.467
students, and the ratio of staff to students

01:32:58.533 --> 01:33:02.333
have to reflect what our taxpayers can

01:33:02.433 --> 01:33:06.300
absorb and what we need to adequately

01:33:06.767 --> 01:33:10.700
and well serve our students, maybe not best serve our

01:33:10.767 --> 01:33:13.400
students. That is not, I think, our job.

01:33:13.667 --> 01:33:16.033
We are trying to fund a public school system.

01:33:16.367 --> 01:33:20.333
It may not be the best, but I think it is adequate, and I think our students

01:33:20.367 --> 01:33:24.333
