01:33:30.467 --> 01:33:34.333
So as much as I wish we could fund

01:33:34.367 --> 01:33:38.100
our school and our program to

01:33:38.133 --> 01:33:40.934
the best of our abilities and have an unending budget,

01:33:42.200 --> 01:33:45.834
I am actually not in favor of increasing the budget.

01:33:46.233 --> 01:33:49.967
I'm not in favor of moving funds from the school

01:33:50.133 --> 01:33:53.533
budget to the city budget. I think we need to have that accurately

01:33:53.567 --> 01:33:54.634
reflected between

01:33:55.533 --> 01:33:56.033
the two.

01:33:57.133 --> 01:33:57.433
And

01:33:58.367 --> 01:34:02.266
again, I know this is a workshop. I know that it's not the final decision, but I

01:34:02.333 --> 01:34:04.767
just wanted to voice that our enrollment has been

01:34:04.800 --> 01:34:08.266
dropping. I think we need to build more housing.

01:34:08.400 --> 01:34:12.133
