01:34:12.166 --> 01:34:15.967
city and not opposing every single building project is a really

01:34:16.000 --> 01:34:19.734
important way for our city to move forward, and I hope that you think about that in

01:34:19.767 --> 01:34:23.433
the future. This is comprehensive. This is what the council is looking at.

01:34:23.800 --> 01:34:27.367
It is every aspect of our city and how we move the city forward.

01:34:27.767 --> 01:34:31.700
And this is a very challenging time for our schools, but it is

01:34:31.734 --> 01:34:34.700
all connected to many different aspects of our city.

01:34:34.734 --> 01:34:38.567
And I know it's challenging, but we sort of have to

01:34:38.600 --> 01:34:42.567
