01:34:57.700 --> 01:34:58.266
voters,

01:34:59.100 --> 01:35:02.700
and I'm just not comfortable with pushing all this forward.

01:35:02.900 --> 01:35:06.834
And I think we're punting the can or kicking the can down the road, and

01:35:06.967 --> 01:35:10.367
I really hope that we can make some reasonable

01:35:10.433 --> 01:35:14.300
decisions and difficult decisions, and that's where I

01:35:14.367 --> 01:35:17.000
am this evening. So thank you.

01:35:17.033 --> 01:35:19.200
Councilor Scott, thank you so much.

01:35:20.734 --> 01:35:24.600
What isn't clear to me is whether you are guiding

01:35:24.667 --> 01:35:27.934
the school board to stay at six, go to seven, or...

01:35:28.567 --> 01:35:31.834
I am currently trying to stay at six.

01:35:32.266 --> 01:35:32.500
Okay.

01:35:32.634 --> 01:35:33.367
Without the

01:35:34.333 --> 01:35:36.333
transfer or SRO-

01:35:36.934 --> 01:35:37.166
Okay

01:35:37.600 --> 01:35:39.033
... additional funding. Thank you.

01:35:39.400 --> 01:35:40.467
Thank you very much.

