Councilor Coleman and Councilor Walker, you want to flip a coin?

01:35:44.967 --> 01:35:46.233
Who's going next?

01:35:47.166 --> 01:35:48.133
Okay. I

01:35:49.133 --> 01:35:50.967
really agree with

01:35:52.567 --> 01:35:52.967
Carter,

01:35:54.066 --> 01:35:57.800
because my recommendation to the school board was three to five.

