My background, I come

01:36:21.066 --> 01:36:23.033
from a medical background, and

01:36:24.000 --> 01:36:27.934
I keep saying so few did so much for

01:36:27.967 --> 01:36:29.200
so many with so little.

01:36:30.333 --> 01:36:30.900
And

