maybe fuller.

01:37:14.066 --> 01:37:18.033
But the cost of fuel in most of the buses, I'm assuming use diesel.

01:37:19.266 --> 01:37:23.100
And we have such uncertain times right now with this

01:37:23.133 --> 01:37:24.066
current government.

01:37:25.500 --> 01:37:29.300
We can't expect anybody to rescue us except for us, so we have to

01:37:29.333 --> 01:37:32.467
really, really tighten our belt. Some of

01:37:33.367 --> 01:37:33.634
us...

01:37:35.300 --> 01:37:38.934
I can tell you, I grew up with you pay your bills, and then you pay

01:37:38.967 --> 01:37:42.867
yourself and really work toward having if you're

01:37:42.934 --> 01:37:44.433
not going to have a job for a year.

01:37:45.934 --> 01:37:49.500
S-live so lean in between

01:37:49.600 --> 01:37:53.166
wants and needs, and I totally agree with

01:37:53.300 --> 01:37:56.967
Counselor Carter. It is a good

01:37:57.333 --> 01:38:00.767
but not the best. It's the best we can within a budget.

