01:38:26.967 --> 01:38:28.567
somebody a quarter, I

01:38:29.500 --> 01:38:32.533
would go without until I paid it, because I just can't have

01:38:32.600 --> 01:38:34.200
an unpaid bill.

01:38:34.400 --> 01:38:34.567
So Counselor-

01:38:34.800 --> 01:38:38.533
So I am saying try to stick to

01:38:38.667 --> 01:38:42.667
