01:38:42.734 --> 01:38:46.500
all of the services. So even though

01:38:46.567 --> 01:38:49.166
it would only raise our budget by

01:38:49.200 --> 01:38:50.667
0.75%,

01:38:51.700 --> 01:38:54.233
$360,000 is

01:38:54.233 --> 01:38:57.834
$360,000. So it's yours.

01:38:58.133 --> 01:39:02.066
Well, thank you. Thank you. So seven and keep the cost.

01:39:02.100 --> 01:39:02.100
Yeah.

01:39:02.934 --> 01:39:03.200
All right.

