You can add, as they say, up to eight, but I'm not certain that that

01:39:07.233 --> 01:39:08.200
budget will pass.

01:39:10.166 --> 01:39:14.100
Okay. Thank you. Thank you very

01:39:14.133 --> 01:39:16.400
much, Counselor Coleman. Counselor Walker.

01:39:17.166 --> 01:39:19.033
Mr. Morille, I have a question for you.

01:39:19.266 --> 01:39:19.600
Okay.

01:39:20.900 --> 01:39:24.367
In the spirit of cooperation and trying

01:39:24.500 --> 01:39:25.667
to partner,

01:39:27.000 --> 01:39:30.567
is there precedent for

01:39:30.667 --> 01:39:31.100
other

01:39:31.967 --> 01:39:33.433
types of solutions

01:39:35.500 --> 01:39:39.467
in terms of things like maybe we start looking

