01:40:04.667 --> 01:40:07.834
But is it possible here? Probably, yeah.

01:40:09.100 --> 01:40:12.767
Do we have an idea of how much the Skillen boiler and the

01:40:13.000 --> 01:40:13.767
Dyer roof are?

01:40:15.467 --> 01:40:15.934
$3 million.

01:40:15.934 --> 01:40:16.500
$3 million for which?

01:40:17.667 --> 01:40:18.100
The boiler.

01:40:18.200 --> 01:40:20.600
The boiler, and then the Dyer roof. Anybody?

01:40:22.367 --> 01:40:22.367
$600,000.

01:40:22.400 --> 01:40:22.700
How much?

01:40:23.433 --> 01:40:24.000
$600,000.

01:40:24.000 --> 01:40:27.066
$600,000. Okay. So, that is something that I would like to explore.

01:40:28.100 --> 01:40:31.967
I'd like to explore moving those big capital costs over into our budget,

01:40:32.333 --> 01:40:33.767
maybe put that as a parking lot

01:40:34.600 --> 01:40:37.734
item. I understand that that's something that no one has thought about so far, but

01:40:37.800 --> 01:40:41.767
I do feel like this is a budget crisis, and we do need to think

01:40:41.834 --> 01:40:45.467
about creative ways that we can partner outside of the

01:40:45.800 --> 01:40:47.467
