01:43:32.867 --> 01:43:36.200
not acceptable for any community. We really should be striving for our best.

01:43:36.600 --> 01:43:40.567
And if that comes with a cost, then we are responsible as a community to bear it

01:43:40.634 --> 01:43:44.533
because those children that we are educating now grow up to be

01:43:44.600 --> 01:43:48.400
the future business owners and leaders in our community, and we owe it to

01:43:48.467 --> 01:43:52.066
ourselves to set them upFor the best path of success

01:43:52.166 --> 01:43:52.667
possible.

01:43:54.133 --> 01:43:56.033
I also believe that tightening of

01:43:56.934 --> 01:44:00.867
