do with this year's deficit, which is going to be this year's deficit.

02:19:03.066 --> 02:19:07.033
And that's part of our budget discussion, as part of our fund balance.

02:19:07.100 --> 02:19:10.600
We're not really discussing that tonight. It sort of came up in the context.

