02:59:00.634 --> 02:59:03.166
So we're going to these mental health crisis calls.

02:59:03.166 --> 02:59:05.033
We're going with our behavioral health liaisons.

02:59:06.200 --> 02:59:10.100
The great model was this co-response model where they would

02:59:10.133 --> 02:59:13.867
co-respond with us. We make the scene safe, and then we

02:59:13.900 --> 02:59:16.400
allow them to come in and do their professional work that they do.

02:59:16.433 --> 02:59:16.634
They're

02:59:18.500 --> 02:59:19.467
licensed social workers.

02:59:19.533 --> 02:59:19.567
Yeah.

02:59:19.567 --> 02:59:21.734
