02:59:21.800 --> 02:59:24.767
We have very minimal training. Although we have good training,

02:59:26.000 --> 02:59:29.934
it's minimal. And so we're actually transitioning,

02:59:29.934 --> 02:59:32.600
and the plan now is to transition to

02:59:33.700 --> 02:59:35.634
them taking on the onus of those calls.

02:59:36.000 --> 02:59:39.734
