03:49:21.600 --> 03:49:24.467
I just want to say that

03:49:24.567 --> 03:49:27.900
it's a bipartisan contentious

03:49:28.867 --> 03:49:30.700
topic. And because

03:49:31.500 --> 03:49:35.100
I did get a copy of the contract, and

03:49:36.300 --> 03:49:39.834
this is going to be brought up in Congress on April

03:49:40.133 --> 03:49:43.400
20th, because there is a data broker

03:49:43.700 --> 03:49:47.133
loophole which allows access to data without a warrant.

03:49:48.000 --> 03:49:52.000
And that our contract has retention period of 30 days when

03:49:52.000 --> 03:49:55.767
the state of Maine has just 21. But I found a

03:49:56.200 --> 03:49:57.166
very disturbing

03:49:58.600 --> 03:50:00.133
paragraph that said, "Flock,

03:50:01.000 --> 03:50:04.900
subject to and during the retention period, Flock may

03:50:05.233 --> 03:50:09.133
access, use, preserve, and/or disclose the

03:50:09.233 --> 03:50:12.934
footage to law enforcement authorities, government

03:50:13.000 --> 03:50:16.400
officials, and/or third parties if legally

03:50:16.467 --> 03:50:20.233
required to do so, if Flock has a

03:50:20.266 --> 03:50:23.367
good faith belief that such access, use,

03:50:23.734 --> 03:50:27.033
preservation, or disclosure is reasonably

03:50:27.166 --> 03:50:31.133
necessary to comply with legal process, enforce the

03:50:31.200 --> 03:50:35.066
agreement, or detect or prevent, otherwise

03:50:35.233 --> 03:50:38.834
address security, privacy fraud, or

03:50:38.967 --> 03:50:41.867
technical issues or emergency

03:50:41.967 --> 03:50:45.433
situations." And this present government

03:50:46.300 --> 03:50:50.233
has used emergency situations to take away rights.

03:50:51.200 --> 03:50:54.734
And right now, the way this operates

03:50:54.834 --> 03:50:56.867
without access to data and a warrant-

03:50:56.900 --> 03:50:57.033
My point of order

03:50:57.033 --> 03:50:59.233
... is a violation of the 14th Amendment.

03:50:59.533 --> 03:51:01.433
So that's why it's going to Congress-

03:51:01.467 --> 03:51:01.533
So-

03:51:01.800 --> 03:51:02.834
... on April 20th.

03:51:02.900 --> 03:51:03.900
All right. So I think-

03:51:04.300 --> 03:51:04.667
Don't worry about it.

03:51:04.700 --> 03:51:05.900
You'll have more information.

03:51:07.000 --> 03:51:07.000
You'll have your chance to respond during the parking lot.Thank you.

03:51:07.033 --> 03:51:07.233
Because that-

03:51:07.233 --> 03:51:07.500
No, no.

03:51:07.500 --> 03:51:08.033
