04:24:37.066 --> 04:24:40.300
loop here looks pretty stagnant. So that's a

04:24:40.300 --> 04:24:43.233
$10,000 increase there. You'll see there's a

04:24:43.567 --> 04:24:47.100
$6,200 increase in the five-year sprinkler

04:24:47.133 --> 04:24:50.433
inspections. That one's just from the Mahoney school.

04:24:50.567 --> 04:24:50.700
So,

04:24:51.533 --> 04:24:53.634
we also have some other five-years coming up.

04:24:53.734 --> 04:24:56.900
So we're trying to get those on our preventative maintenance schedule

04:24:57.567 --> 04:25:00.367
now so that we can get those things done and take care of business.

04:25:02.000 --> 04:25:03.100
So that would be the,

04:25:05.600 --> 04:25:08.100
