04:26:29.800 --> 04:26:31.000
So we went through

04:26:32.000 --> 04:26:35.400
a lot of the money, so as you can see, my projection for this year,

04:26:35.467 --> 04:26:39.266
we had budgeted 144. My projection was

04:26:39.467 --> 04:26:43.100
173. That's closer to where we're going to be.

04:26:44.400 --> 04:26:47.266
