04:26:50.567 --> 04:26:54.400
due to, I expect the same thing to happen in some of these older buildings.

04:26:54.467 --> 04:26:57.800
They're getting older. Things are starting to happen with the library, at the

04:26:57.867 --> 04:27:01.400
